{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19997","headline":"立德新居 二 · 孟郊","name":"立德新居 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耸城架霄汉，洁宅涵絪緼。\n开门洛北岸，时锁嵩阳云。\n夜高星辰大，昼长天地分。\n厚韵属疎语，薄名谢嚣闻。\n兹焉有殊隔，永矣难及羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}